research/audit/wave12-dispatch/certifier-a6-fs-the-rearrangement-sums-of-a-non-absolutely-convergent-series-fill-the-space-r2.log:6108:research/audit/wave12-dispatch/audit-refuter-fs-the-rearrangement-sums-of-a-non-absolutely-convergent-series-fill-the-space.prompt.md-521-    "target": "def-the-space-of-summing-directions",
