    37	directions** of $(x_k)$: those $a$ for which the real series of the projections
    38	$\langle a, x_k\rangle$ converges absolutely
    39	([[def-absolute-and-conditional-convergence]]). Both sets depend on the sequence
    40	$(x_k)$; when several are in play the notation is $\Gamma(x)$ and
