    44	already defined in [[def-linear-map]], so a linear functional can be read as a
    45	linear map into $\mathbb{R}$. This library does not yet define the dual space or
    46	prove that every such functional on $\mathbb{R}^{n}$ is represented by an inner
    47	product with a vector. Writing $\Gamma$ with Euclidean directions avoids
    48	presupposing that agreement, and nothing on this page depends on it.
    49	
