   101	
   102	### Affine subspaces
   103	
   104	The library has no notion of an affine subspace, so one is fixed here. For a
   105	linear subspace $W \subseteq \mathbb{R}^{n}$ and $s \in \mathbb{R}^{n}$, the
   106	**affine subspace through $s$ with direction $W$** is the coset
